": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-quGML8eGcoQ7kNvwHoqxfq&_nc_oc=AdqLDdsfKUxDO6_RhHdumdooHfTLxis5SFRa_z3srISR_VZQWLR2fOlDE1IwTthSFS0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFwPCokFDnFXACcyDCM26QniTUPSXP7fbQJ8kQIXT1ARQ&oe=6A97305B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r5YmUBcwWl4Q7kNvwHzcYgT&_nc_oc=AdrSgJVBGnQOmRJOPaFmfaF-enQ5WHrZWRlobsrH2Q1VYWUxZCMV-2l-s6MUwn6oK2s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE_0oMG1-gOvl7X8yUnATL1FOR1khhNIcsw3xFfKzNUng&oe=6A9720A1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BiN1gGiz_zoQ7kNvwG0-yOd&_nc_oc=AdqRfJ2Lc2qzYJnVmyylggVqQBwYEM7PsPLiA4CMRpvUdbFJZLaUG9JXteKdtiYjNiE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHKXfdm_cZIhlSr4XG6lGscRBKqonGhW1xeaHKWNvNWXA&oe=6A9745AF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PK4cypOl0KUQ7kNvwG0Cy2p&_nc_oc=AdqjVgsi4FcSbSxHvLShWeyAt1zDKqIkOAvoQDCVx8Xu6IX6ZFjuyfe2S1bhL7bfj-0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHMOnks6a-_4M0Fmcno9TxKIJGAV4fc6LzAn0UkEWFlig&oe=6A974552"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xuP-lrcBHEUQ7kNvwHGhZ8n&_nc_oc=Adq1AFSOl_JcgoKFEKbn6ANZDqeCu_LtpDzYbC8hUs3F-5UOkq6PHpy8SnvZoDOJPDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFmsBtWGKWLAjRAPQF8iK54Io3ogq07hdGpFq3SDS7Jpw&oe=6A974EFD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a